{
"classname" "target_print"
"origin" "-96.000000 -2944.000000 -404.000000"
"targetname" "grangenesis_4"
"message" "Granger considered, and with naught but thought, spat her seed at the Void. "
"spawnflags" "4"
}
{
"classname" "target_print"
"origin" "-112.000000 -2944.000000 -404.000000"
"targetname" "grangenesis_5"
"message" "Thus, the Stars were born of her eternal warmth."
"spawnflags" "4"
}
{
"classname" "target_print"
"origin" "-128.000000 -2944.000000 -404.000000"
"targetname" "grangenesis_6"
"message" "Granger was satisfied."
"spawnflags" "4"
}
{
"classname" "target_print"
"origin" "-144.000000 -2944.000000 -404.000000"
"targetname" "grangenesis_7"
"message" "But the Children of Granger began to demand more than the Void and the Stars. "
"spawnflags" "4"
}
{
"classname" "target_print"
"origin" "-160.000000 -2944.000000 -404.000000"
"targetname" "grangenesis_8a"
"message" "And so the Children of Granger asked of their mother:"
"spawnflags" "4"
}
{
"classname" "target_print"
"origin" "-176.000000 -2944.000000 -404.000000"
"targetname" "grangenesis_8b"
"message" "Give us each a small portion of the Egg for us to create that which is not Egg and that which is not Void and that which is not Star."
"spawnflags" "4"
}
{
"classname" "target_print"
"origin" "-192.000000 -2944.000000 -404.000000"
"targetname" "grangenesis_9"
"message" "For each child, Granger sliced off a piece of the Egg of Life, thus granting them each their Egg."
"spawnflags" "4"
}
